{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wondered what it's like to be a CCTV operator watching paranormal footage where you can die at any given moment? A life threatening job, for sure. But an exciting one nonetheless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your predecessor ended badly, but <u>will you</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Become a new Anomaly Observer today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.poster.avif?t=1753787352\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.webm?t=1753787352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.mp4?t=1753787352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore all cameras in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find changes happening while on shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive until 6 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.poster.avif?t=1753787352\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.webm?t=1753787352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.mp4?t=1753787352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 different areas where paranormal things are happening! <u>Each new area is more difficult, than the previous one.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience weirdest phenomena and anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with other Anomaly Observers in Leaderboards and become the best one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anomalies are more and more intensive as the contract goes on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No contract is the same - <u><strong>there are hundreds of different anomalies that can happen at any given time!</strong></u></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793510?t=1753787352","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/68bbff9a091b504d6f1ca2a131659c3a6409ee56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753787352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/9a24fd4ce5132d0ec8b84833acd507d4d0013d4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753787352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/9a24fd4ce5132d0ec8b84833acd507d4d0013d4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753787352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game contains jumpscares, disturbing monsters, occasional blood and corpses"},"demos":[{"appid":3903230,"descr